  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3 — Validation & Testing:\n\t\t\t- Schema Validation Engine: validate appsettings files against a JSON Schema (draft-07 subset) before every save; violations are surfaced inline in the tree view and as a banner above the editor. Schema is also passed to Monaco Editor for live autocomplete and hover documentation.\n\t\t\t- Configuration Assertion Runner: implement IConfigurationTest in your project to define assertions against your configuration; tests are discoverable at startup and runnable on demand from the new Tests panel in the UI.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tv1.2 — Backup & History Management:\n\t\t\t- Versioned Backup System: backup files now include a timestamp and optional version prefix, e.g. appsettings.json.v1.2.1.20240601T1530.bak; sequential versioning tracked independently per environment file.\n\t\t\t- Backup Restore & History: full backup history panel with key-level diff preview and one-click restore; restore automatically creates a pre-restore backup of the current state.\n\t\t\t- Change Audit Log: append-only per-file audit log recording timestamp, operation type, key path, old value, and new value; viewable in the Audit tab of the right sidebar; optionally forwarded to ILogger.",
